e Generation\",\n      \"code\": \"type: String(kvps.action), module: String(kvps.module), item: kvps.item as Record<string, unknown>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"severity\": \"medium\",\n      \"file\": \"src/lib/csrf.ts\",\n      \"line\": 18,\n      \"type\": \"Insecure Cookie Attributes\",\n      \"description\": \"CSRF token cookie is missing the 'Secure' flag. In production (HTTPS), this flag must be set to prevent the cookie from being transmitted over unencrypted HTTP connections. Current cookie: 'csrf_token_{runtimeId}={token}; SameSite=Strict; Path=/' should include 'Secure'.\",\n      \"cwe\": \"CWE-614: Sensitive Cookie in HTTPS Session Without Secure Attribute\",\n      \"code\": \"document.cookie = `csrf_token_${runtimeId}=${csrfToken}; SameSite=Strict; Path=/`;\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"severity\": \"medium\",\n      \"file\": \"src/lib/socket-client.ts\",\n      \"line\": 20,\n      \"type\": \"Sensitive Data Logging\",\n      \"description\": \"Console logging of snapshot data (lines with console.log) in state_push handler could expose sensitive information from the Agent Zero context, including chat history, tool inputs, or internal state.\",\n      \"cwe\": \"CWE-532: Insertion of Sensitive Information into Log File\",\n      \"code\": \"console.log(`[state_push] ${snap.logs.length} logs...`)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"severity\": \"medium\",\n      \"file\": \"src/hooks/use-workspace.ts\",\n      \"line\": 30,\n      \"type\": \"Insufficient Error Detail in Response Parsing\",\n      \"description\": \"The fetch response is parsed as JSON without checking Content-Type header. Malformed responses could cause unexpected behavior. While error is caught, the error message only shows status code, potentially hiding security-relevant details.\",\n      \"cwe\": \"CWE-209: Information Exposure Through an Error Message\",\n      \"code\": \"const json = await res.json(); setError(err.message);\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"severity\": \"low\",\n      \"file\": \